WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:03.180
Euchre is four players,
in two teams of two.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.510
Your partner sits across from you.

00:00:05.715 --> 00:00:07.745
Tricks you win count for both of you.

00:00:07.975 --> 00:00:10.285
These teams are Deer Camp and Lake Effect.

00:00:11.483 --> 00:00:15.113
The deck has 24 cards,
nine through ace in each suit.

00:00:15.393 --> 00:00:17.083
Each player gets five cards.

00:00:17.488 --> 00:00:19.258
One card is turned face up.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.800
Trump is the suit that
beats every other suit.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.910
Bidding starts left of the dealer.

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:27.920
A player may order up
the turned card, or pass.

00:00:28.365 --> 00:00:30.535
Order it up, and that suit becomes trump.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.590
The dealer picks the card
up and throws one away.

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:36.800
The dealer does that even
when an opponent ordered it.

00:00:37.783 --> 00:00:40.553
If everyone passes,
the card is turned down.

00:00:40.823 --> 00:00:42.533
A player may name a different suit.

00:00:42.873 --> 00:00:45.083
Any suit except the one turned down.

00:00:45.348 --> 00:00:47.438
Nobody picks up a card in this round.

00:00:47.768 --> 00:00:50.818
If the other three pass,
the dealer must name a suit.

00:00:51.158 --> 00:00:52.448
That is stick the dealer.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:56.180
Going alone means you
play without your partner.

00:00:56.475 --> 00:01:00.825
Only the player who just made trump can
do it, and they say so as they call.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:04.910
Your partner lays their cards
down and sits the whole hand out.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.510
You take on both opponents by yourself.

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:09.300
Each trick has three cards.

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:11.220
You still need three tricks.

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:13.530
Three or four is still one point.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.530
Win all five, and your team
scores four points instead of two.

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:20.870
Win fewer than three,
and the other team scores two.

00:01:21.135 --> 00:01:23.585
Same score as when you
play with your partner.

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:27.145
If the dealer's partner goes alone,
the dealer sits out.

00:01:27.385 --> 00:01:29.295
The turned card is not picked up.

00:01:30.317 --> 00:01:33.667
The jack of trump is the highest card:
the right bower.

00:01:33.967 --> 00:01:35.297
Bower rhymes with flower.

00:01:35.712 --> 00:01:39.242
Next is the left bower,
the other jack of the same color.

00:01:39.527 --> 00:01:40.837
Hearts pair with diamonds.

00:01:41.332 --> 00:01:42.642
Spades pair with clubs.

00:01:43.087 --> 00:01:46.577
With hearts as trump,
the jack of diamonds counts as a heart.

00:01:46.882 --> 00:01:48.592
It is not a diamond anymore.

00:01:48.987 --> 00:01:52.037
After that come ace, king,
queen, ten, and nine.

00:01:52.307 --> 00:01:54.957
The jack of the other color
stays in its own suit.

00:01:55.257 --> 00:01:57.387
Suits that are not trump rank ace high.

00:01:58.417 --> 00:02:01.527
A trick is one card from each
player still in the hand.

00:02:01.797 --> 00:02:03.967
Left of the dealer leads the first trick.

00:02:04.267 --> 00:02:06.037
Skip anyone who is sitting out.

00:02:06.297 --> 00:02:08.807
Follow the suit that was led,
if you have it.

00:02:09.047 --> 00:02:12.517
The left bower follows trump,
not the suit printed on it.

00:02:12.717 --> 00:02:15.547
If you have none of that suit,
play any card you like.

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:16.632
You may trump.

00:02:17.047 --> 00:02:18.217
You do not have to.

00:02:18.582 --> 00:02:20.312
The highest trump wins the trick.

00:02:20.627 --> 00:02:23.337
A nine of trump beats
an ace of another suit.

00:02:23.647 --> 00:02:27.277
If no trump is played,
the highest card of the led suit wins.

00:02:27.632 --> 00:02:30.442
That team keeps the trick,
and the winner leads next.

00:02:30.847 --> 00:02:33.237
You play five tricks, one for each card.

00:02:34.283 --> 00:02:37.153
The team that named trump
has to take three tricks.

00:02:37.508 --> 00:02:39.458
Three or four tricks score one point.

00:02:39.773 --> 00:02:41.343
All five score two points.

00:02:41.713 --> 00:02:44.003
All five while going alone score four.

00:02:44.293 --> 00:02:46.803
Three or four while alone still score one.

00:02:47.003 --> 00:02:49.428
Fewer than three, and they are euchred.

00:02:49.478 --> 00:02:52.168
The other team scores two, alone or not.

00:02:52.433 --> 00:02:54.863
The first team to ten
points wins the game.

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:57.420
The table is on the TV.

00:02:57.830 --> 00:02:59.360
Your cards are on your phone.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:02.100
Order it up,
or pick it up when you are the dealer.

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:04.270
Pass and go alone are there too.

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:06.660
Name trump, or pass.

00:03:07.085 --> 00:03:09.575
Follow suit, and the left bower is trump.

00:03:09.925 --> 00:03:11.135
Three tricks to score.

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:13.360
All five alone is four points.

